.TH KT 1 "2026-08-22" "kt 1.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kt \- scaffold Make, nFPM, systemd, and tag-based release projects
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kt
.RI [ global-options ]
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kt
is a small project scaffolding tool for applications packaged with Make, nFPM,
and systemd. It creates project templates, maintains the local
.I .kt/project.yaml
manifest, validates deploy files, and manages tag-based releases.
.PP
The generated projects deliberately stay boring: Make builds, nFPM packages,
systemd runs services, and external deployment automation decides when to
install, migrate, restart, and roll back.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Use machine-readable output where supported.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet, \-q
Suppress non-error status output.
.TP
.B \-\-no-color
Disable ANSI styling.
.TP
.B \-\-color auto|always|never
Control ANSI styling.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Project commands
.TP
.B kt templates
List available project templates.
.TP
.B kt init
Start an interactive scaffold prompt.
.TP
.B kt init \fItemplate\fR \fIapp\fR [\-\-dir \fIdir\fR] [\-\-force] [\-\-dry-run]
Create a project from a template. Supported templates are
.BR service ,
.BR cli ,
.BR mixed ,
.BR multi ,
and legacy
.BR app .
.TP
.B kt config get \fIkey\fR
Print one value from
.IR .kt/project.yaml .
.TP
.B kt config set \fIkey\fR \fIvalue\fR
Update or append a top-level scalar value in
.IR .kt/project.yaml .
.TP
.B kt config show [\-\-json]
Print the project manifest. With
.BR \-\-json ,
prints the normalized contract as JSON.
.TP
.B kt config shape
Print the normalized project shape.
.TP
.B kt config validate
Validate app name, kind, services, service paths, and service account fields.
.TP
.B kt config edit
Open
.IR .kt/project.yaml
in
.BR VISUAL ,
.BR EDITOR ,
or
.BR vi ,
then validate it.
.TP
.B kt config schema
Print the
.B kt.project/v1
JSON schema.
.TP
.B kt config migrate \-\-to kt.project/v1
Rewrite a legacy manifest into the structured
.B kt.project/v1
format.
.TP
.B kt config init|diff|check
Delegate to the generated Make config targets for
.IR deploy/config .
.SS Deploy commands
.TP
.B kt deploy inspect [\-\-json]
Print deploy metadata derived from
.IR .kt/project.yaml ,
including structured services, config/data/log directories, unit names, and
installed runner paths.
.TP
.B kt deploy metadata [\-\-json] [\-\-output \fIfile\fR]
Print deploy metadata as JSON, or write it to a file.
.TP
.B kt deploy check [\-\-json]
Validate the project manifest, package manifest, config examples, service
runners, systemd units, unit entrypoints, executable bits, and stale lifecycle
scripts.
.SS Release commands
.TP
.B kt release next patch|minor|major [\-\-pre \fIlabel\fR]
Print the next stable version, or the first prerelease when
.B \-\-pre
is supplied.
.TP
.B kt release next pre
Increment the current prerelease number.
.TP
.B kt release next stable
Promote the current prerelease to a stable version.
.TP
.B kt release plan patch|minor|major|\fIversion\fR [\-\-pre \fIlabel\fR] [\-\-json]
Preview the current release, next version, tag, dirty state, and local/remote
tag conflicts.
.TP
.B kt release notes [\fIrange\fR|\-\-since latest]
Print Markdown bullet release notes from
.B git log --oneline .
.TP
.B kt release validate \fIvversion\fR [\-\-github-output]
Validate a strict
.B v<semver>
tag. With
.BR \-\-github-output ,
writes
.B version
and
.B prerelease
outputs for CI.
.TP
.B kt release tag \fIversion\fR
Create an immutable annotated local tag at HEAD.
.TP
.B kt release push \fIversion\fR
Create and push an immutable annotated tag to
.BR origin .
.SS Tooling commands
.TP
.B kt install-tools [\-\-dir \fIdir\fR] [\-\-force] [\-\-check|\-\-diff] [\-\-apply]
Install shared
.I .kt/mk
tooling into an existing project, or check/diff it against the embedded copy.
.TP
.B kt update-tools [\-\-dir \fIdir\fR] [\-\-force] [\-\-check|\-\-diff] [\-\-apply]
Refresh shared
.I .kt/mk
tooling. Updates overwrite by default. Use
.B \-\-check
for CI drift detection,
.B \-\-diff
for inspection, and
.B \-\-apply
to refresh after check/diff.
.TP
.B kt update [\-\-check] [\-\-prerelease]
Update the
.B kt
binary from Gitea releases. Downloads are verified against
.BR SHA256SUMS .
.TP
.B kt doctor
Run generated project doctor checks.
.TP
.B kt version
Print kt version, commit, and build date.
.TP
.B kt completion bash|zsh|fish
Print shell completion snippets.
.SH PROJECT MANIFEST
Every scaffold writes
.IR .kt/project.yaml .
New scaffolds include
.BR schema:
.BR kt.project/v1 .
Key fields are
.BR template ,
.BR app ,
.BR kind ,
.BR package ,
.BR services ,
.BR commands ,
.BR config ,
.BR release ,
and
.BR kt .
.PP
The
.B services
field is a structured list for new service-bearing projects. Each service entry
can name its role, runner path, systemd unit path, user, and group. Legacy
comma-separated service names still load for older projects.
.SH GENERATED METADATA
.TP
.I dist/app/meta/build.json
Build metadata written by
.BR make build-metadata .
.TP
.I dist/app/meta/deploy.json
Deploy metadata written by
.BR make build-metadata ,
matching
.BR kt deploy metadata --json .
.TP
.I .kt/project.yaml
Project contract used by kt, Make, and packaging.
.TP
.I .kt/mk/
Shared generated Make includes.
.TP
.I deploy/
Generated deploy source tree: config examples, package hooks, systemd units,
service runners, and user-facing commands.
.TP
.I nfpm.yaml
nFPM package manifest.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KT_VERSION
Install script override for an exact release version.
.TP
.B KT_PRERELEASE
Install script opt-in for latest prerelease selection.
.TP
.B BIN_DIR
Install script binary destination. Defaults to
.IR /usr/local/bin .
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
kt init service my-api
kt --json deploy inspect
kt deploy metadata --json
kt config migrate --to kt.project/v1
kt deploy check
kt release notes --since latest
kt release plan minor
kt release next minor --pre rc
kt release push 1.4.0
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR make (1),
.BR systemd.service (5),
.BR nfpm (1)
